<div class="page-wrapper">
    <NavBanner />
    <div id="cards" class="main-wrapper">
      <section class="section-hero case-study">
        <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-1280 w-container">
          <div class="wrapper-hero fr-1-15">
            <div class="left-hero max-680">
              <div wb-interval-delay="0.2" wb-component="smart-animate" class="gap-4">
                <div class="w-layout-hflex flex-block-2">
                  <a href="/resources/customer-stories" class="text-caps">Customer stories</a>
                  <div class="text-caps">&gt;</div>
                  <div class="text-caps">Kuberno</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">This wasn’t just about a fresh logo; it was about crafting a brand and digital presence that matched their ambition, stood out in the competitive AI space, and resonated with their target audience.</div>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80 hide">Through close collaboration and iterative feedback, we partnered with them to launch their new identity and create a powerful foundation for growth, ensuring their brand reflected their evolution and their goals as a startup.</div>
                <h1 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Kuberno: </span>Creating a Product Launch Video in Under 2 Weeks</h1>
                <div class="text-16-150 color-white-80">Kuberno needed a fast, clear way to bring their product vision to life. We helped create a <strong>dynamic video</strong> in just <strong>10 working days</strong> that <strong>illustrated their future plans</strong>, translating complex concepts into easy-to-understand, visually engaging content. Using 2D stylized UI animation, we captured attention, stayed on brand, and delivered flexible assets that can evolve alongside their product, helping communicate strategy and vision effectively to any audience.</div>
              </div>
