                      <div>
                        <h2 class="h1"><span class="span-pink-2">Kuberno</span></h2>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-16-150 opacity-80">You may have heard of Kuberno, a leader in the legal and RegTech space. They work with major clients like Deliveroo, Citizens, and Nationwide, providing solutions for entity management and compliance. In October 2024, they raised $9.5 million in Series A funding, backed by Barclays and Nasdaq, positioning them for rapid growth. As part of their marketing strategy, Kuberno wanted to use videos to showcase their product vision and future plans, helping their audience understand the direction of their platform and the impact they aim to deliver. With ambitious goals in place, they were ready to elevate their brand and communicate their strategy effectively.</div>
