                <div class="text-caps weight-regular">the plus points</div>
                <h2 class="h2"><span class="span-pink-2">Why Kuberno chose us</span></h2>
              </div>
              <div wb-component="smart-animate" class="text-16-150 color-white-80">Kuberno needed a high-quality video delivered fast, with clear pricing from the start. With a budget of under $26,000, they were looking for a video partner who could move quickly, scope the project properly, and create stylized UI mockups for a product that was still in development. Our transparent pricing made the process easier, with superfast delivery, duration adjustments, and voiceover support already listed on our website, so they could quickly see what they needed and how much it would cost.</div><img sizes="(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px" srcset="/images/Frame-1707478537_2Frame-1707478537.avif 500w, /images/Frame-1707478537_2.avif 2400w" alt="A purple background with squares and dots" src="/images/Frame-1707478537_2.avif" loading="lazy" class="image-why_shoose">
